OL,3,GNEWSAStation part of 'everyday life' on
OL,4,Abiomedical campus
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 400,000 journeys have been
OL,7,Fmade through a railway station which
OL,8,Fopened 100 days ago.
OL,10,FCambridge South opened to the public on
OL,11,F28 June and welcomes up to 20 services
OL,12,Fduring peak hours alone.
OL,14,FThe station links to the city's
OL,15,FBiomedical Campus (CBC), home to
OL,16,FAddenbrooke's Hospital and the Royal
OL,17,FPapworth Hospital NHS Foundation Trust,
OL,18,Falongside a number of private
OL,19,Fcompanies, including AstraZeneca.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
