OL,3,GNEWSAStation part of 'everyday life' on
OL,4,Abiomedical campus
OL,5,
OL,6,FCBC managing director Nick Kirby said:
OL,7,F"Over the first 100 days, Cambridge
OL,8,FSouth has become part of everyday life
OL,9,Fon the Cambridge Biomedical Campus."
